# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  💡  THEME VARIANT REFERENCE TABLE
#
#  ASH ships with optimized color mappings for every theme category.
#  When you switch themes, ASH selects the appropriate mapping:
#
#  ┌──────────────────────┬─────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
#  │ Theme Category       │ CPU Graph Style  │ Accent Strategy              │
#  ├──────────────────────┼─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤
#  │ dark/catppuccin-*    │ Mauve gradient   │ Purple-blue spectrum         │
#  │ dark/tokyo-night     │ Blue gradient    │ Cyan-blue spectrum           │
#  │ dark/gruvbox-*       │ Orange gradient  │ Warm earth tones            │
#  │ dark/nord            │ Arctic blue      │ Frost + polar night          │
#  │ dark/dracula         │ Purple gradient  │ Pink-purple spectrum         │
#  │ dark/rose-pine       │ Rose gradient    │ Pine + rose + gold           │
#  │ dark/everforest      │ Forest green     │ Earth + aqua                 │
#  │ dark/kanagawa-*      │ Wave gradient    │ Dragon + wave blues          │
#  │ light/catppuccin-*   │ Mauve on cream   │ Purple on warm whites        │
#  │ light/rose-pine-dawn │ Rose on cream    │ Gold + rose on ivory         │
#  │ neon/cyberpunk-*     │ Cyan-yellow      │ Electric neon spectrum       │
#  │ neon/synthwave-84    │ Purple-pink      │ Retrowave spectrum           │
#  │ neon/matrix-*        │ Pure green       │ Matrix green spectrum        │
#  │ nature/forest-*      │ Forest green     │ Natural earth palette        │
#  │ nature/ocean-*       │ Ocean blue       │ Deep sea blues               │
#  │ nature/aurora-*      │ Aurora green-pink│ Borealis spectrum            │
#  │ space/nebula-*       │ Cosmic purple    │ Deep space blues/purples     │
#  │ retro/vaporwave      │ Hot pink         │ Pink-purple retrowave        │
#  └──────────────────────┴─────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
#
#  Each variant override is stored in:
#  ~/.config/ash/engines/color-engine/templates/btop.template
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━